  "body": "Titles and CCCs are issued, and the homes are ready to move into now.\r\n1 Sold Only 3 left, Act fast!!\r\n\r\nMore than simply brand new, these homes have been created for buyers who value quality, comfort and the way a home feels to live in every day.\r\n\r\nASKING $1,739,000 - 23A\r\n172.4m² Floor Area| 13.1m² deck\r\n\r\nASKING $1,880,000 - 23B\r\n191.2m² Floor Area | 23m² deck | 11.8m² balcony | 9.41m² storage\r\n\r\nASKING $1,880,000 - 23C\r\n191.2m² Floor Area | 21.58m² deck | 11.8m² balcony | 7.81m² storage\r\n\r\nASKING $1,980,000 - 23D.  (Sold)\r\n191.2m² Floor Area | 35.27m² deck | 11.8m² balcony | 12.61m² storage\r\n\r\nSet in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods, 23 Channel View Road presents four beautifully finished freehold homes, each offering four bedrooms, three bathrooms, a guest powder room and a single internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, there is a clear sense of quality.\r\n\r\nNatural timber and stone finishes, generous glazing and carefully considered detailing give each home a warm, refined feel. Floor-to-ceiling windows bring in excellent natural light, while the open-plan living spaces have been designed to feel spacious, comfortable and easy to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen sits at the heart of the home, combining clean contemporary design with practical everyday functionality. Living and dining areas flow naturally to private decks, balconies and landscaped outdoor spaces, creating an effortless connection between indoors and out.\r\n\r\nThese are homes designed not only to look good on viewing day, but to work well for real life.\r\n\r\nFull central heating and cooling provides year-round comfort, while smart-home features including lighting control, CCTV, video doorbell and remote garage access add convenience and security.\r\n\r\nLots B, C and D also feature a private internal lift connecting all three levels, adding genuine long-term flexibility for families, multi-generational living or buyers planning ahead.\r\n\r\nCampbells Bay offers the lifestyle many North Shore buyers are looking for - close to the beach, parks, cafés, local amenities and excellent schooling.\r\n\r\nFor buyers who value thoughtful design, quality finishes and easy modern living, 23 Channel View Road is well worth seeing in person.\r\n\r\nContact Jacky Yu - 0212333771 For Private Viewing.",
